flowchart TD
  A["Order Packed → assign driver + route"] --> C["Out for delivery"]
  C --> D{"Handed over?"}
  D -- Yes --> E["Proof of delivery (OD-40) · COD collected if due → Delivered"]
  D -- No --> G["Record failed attempt: reason, time, proof · notify customer"]
  G --> I{"Re-attempt allowed? (OD-16)"}
  I -- "Yes + customer agrees slot" --> J["Reserve new slot atomically"] --> C
  I -- No --> K["Return goods to hub"]
  K --> L{"Still sellable?"}
  L -- Yes --> M["Restock movement"]
  L -- No --> N["Waste movement"]
  M --> O["Returned · refund or charges per policy (OD-16)"]
  N --> O
